nd also balance out  the added sugar in her day  especially if we can include a source of  iron rich protein like beans  legumes eggs tofu meat nuts or seeds  which would also help her meet those  really high iron needs for teens  i also would say you know just enjoy the  carps  but let's try not to let them be naked  so if you remember from my video on pcos  naked carbs  are just kind of what they sound like  they're a source of carbs  at a meal or a snack with nothing else  to beef it up  but by pairing that carb with protein or  fat  or at least choosing a higher fiber  option  we'll see more stable energy levels and  better staying power  so let's add nutritious foods to the  carbs and not think that we need to just  cut them out i also want to talk about  caroline's relationship with food  now i have to just say it is really  refreshing to see  a normal teenage girl eat like a normal  teenage girl  sure we could probably all agree that  yogurt pretzels are not as nutritious as  yogurt  and blueberry waffles are not as  nutritious as blueberries  but i'm just happy to see a young girl  with a profile as  big as hers on the internet not  promoting  some kind of bogus cleanse so this kind  of content  is really important for young girls and  boys to watch  in fact this is exactly how i used to  eat before diet culture got a hold of me  and i wish more young people could just  like  relish in this outlook on food a little  bit longer  or like i don't know for life but  honestly this is such a delicate age so  i do want to encourage caroline to focus  on those little changes  to help balance out enjoyment with what  feels good  in her body and gives her the energy  that she needs  to do the things that she loves don't  let diet culture tell you that you  shouldn't eat sugar at breakfast  but if you find the energy is waning by  second period at school  let's try to find some strategies to  help bulk that up  this is really what gentle nutrition is  all about  honoring your body and your mind and  doing so  in the most sustainable kind way  possible  i'm just gonna pop back in here again to  reiterate that i am  saddened by the latest wedding in a day  video  i am really hoping that this was an off  day and that caroline  isn't slowly like whittling away at her  intake  because you know between working out and  cheer practice that day  the girl needs her calories now it is  not  uncommon for teenagers to graze their  way  through the day but i really would like  to see her prioritize some balanced  meals  back into the mix so this is my gentle  nudge to caroline whom  i really do hope can find a happy medium  between  listening to her body about maybe  consuming excess added sugar  and fueling her body with enough  calories and energy to grow  adolescence is not the time to be under  nourishing  so folks that is all that i have for you  guys today thank you again to  squarespace for sponsoring this video  if you liked it give me the thumbs up  leave me a comment below on some other  youtubers to review  subscribe to the channel and i'll see  you next time on abby's kitchen  bye  you
 

